  "prefLabel": "Sep 401.01 Expirations and Renewals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sep 401.01 Expirations and Renewals. Pursuant to RSA 310:8, licenses shall be renewed by written application prior to the expiration date and by payment of the prescribed renewal fee. The licensing bureau shall notify each septic system evaluator at least 2 months prior to expiration of their license. If properly renewed, a license shall remain in effect for 2 years from the date of issuance unless suspended or revoked.\n\nSource. #12654, eff 10-31-18; ss by #14361, eff 10-26-25, EXPIRES: 10-26-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sep100-700.html"
